LeetCode SQL 50 Solutions Journey

A curated collection of my solutions to the **LeetCode SQL 50** study plan.

This repository showcases my approach to solving SQL problems from the official **LeetCode SQL 50** study plan. It serves as a structured reference for learning SQL, strengthening database concepts, and preparing for coding interviews. Each solution is written with a focus on readability, correctness, and efficient query design.

## 📖 Repository Overview

* Platform:LeetCode
* Study Plan: SQL 50
* Language: SQL
* Focus Areas: SQL Fundamentals, Query Optimization, Database Concepts
* Purpose: SQL Interview Preparation & Continuous Learning

📂 Repository Structure

leetcode-sql-50/
│
├── README.md
└── solutions/
    ├── 0175-combine-two-tables.sql
    ├── 0176-second-highest-salary.sql
    ├── 0181-employees-earning-more-than-their-managers.sql
    ├── 0197-rising-temperature.sql
    ├── ...
    └── 1978-employees-whose-manager-left-the-company.sql

Each solution file is named using the **LeetCode problem number** followed by the **problem title**, making it easy to locate and reference individual problems.

🧠 Topics Covered

* Basic SQL Queries
* Filtering & Sorting
* Aggregate Functions
* GROUP BY & HAVING
* CASE Expressions
* JOIN Operations
* Subqueries
* Common Table Expressions (CTEs)
* Window Functions
* String Functions
* Date Functions
* NULL Handling

🎯 Repository Goal

The objective of this repository is to build a strong foundation in SQL by solving the **LeetCode SQL 50** study plan. It reflects consistent practice, strengthens problem-solving skills, and serves as a personal reference for SQL interview preparation.


